# The workspace root .gitignore ignores `data/` at any depth, which would
# make the committed H3 / Urban Strategy fixture caches unreachable (git
# cannot re-include files under an excluded directory). Re-include the
# directory chain down to data/cache/h3/ and data/cache/us/ (fixture writers
# write <fingerprint>.json entries there, committed so the offline test
# suite never invokes nldt), keep every other data/ content ignored as
# before, and exclude subprocess scratch requests (*/req/, never committed).
!data/
data/*
!data/cache/
data/cache/*
!data/cache/h3/
data/cache/h3/req/
!data/cache/us/
data/cache/us/req/

# Local secrets (API keys) — never commit
.env.local
scenarios/.env.local

